[ti:ॐ हिरण्यगर्भः समवर्तताग्रे II]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]ॐ हिरण्यगर्भः समवर्तताग्रे
[00:11.81]भूतस्य जातः पतिरेक आसीत्
[00:15.61]Om hiraṇyagarbhaḥ samavartatāgre
[00:19.42]bhūtasya jātaḥ patireka āsīt
[00:23.22]Before the stars and before the sky,
[00:27.03]A golden egg in silence lie.
[00:30.84]No darkness there, no beam of light,
[00:34.64]Just cosmic breath in endless night.
[00:38.45]Sabse pahle Hiranyagarbha, golden womb divine,
[00:42.25]Shunya ke andar dhadakta tha the seed of space-time.
[00:46.06]Anda phoota — Bhumi neeche, Dyaus upar udaya,
[00:49.87]Rigveda ke mantra se brahmand jagmagaya.
[00:53.67]Akshar bane agni jaise, dhvani bani praan,
[00:57.48]ऋषियों के ध्यान से जन्मा सारा विज्ञान।
[01:01.28]Phir Pangu jaaga chaos ke ande ke beech,
[01:05.09]Dàdàn phat gaya jab usne liya stretch.
[01:08.90]Tiān aur Dì ko alag karta, khada raha yugon tak,
[01:12.70]Atharah hazaar saal tak dhakka deta akash tak.
[01:16.51]Fēng bani saans uski, Yun bane badal,
[01:20.31]Sharir se bane pahaad aur dariya nirmal.
[01:24.12]Door uttar mein Kalevala ki kahani boli,
[01:27.93]Ek hans udi samundar par akeli aur bhooli।
[01:31.73]Saat ande Kulta ke toot gaye lehron mein,
[01:35.54]Suraj nikla tukdon se sitaron ke shehron mein।
[01:39.34]Chand bana ek tukda, samay bana dhaar,
[01:43.15]Din-mahine-saal sab jag gaye ek baar।
[01:46.96]Orphic egg se nikla Phanes, jyoti ka dev,
[01:50.76]Golden wings wale praan se jag hua sev।
[01:54.57]Chaos se cosmos bana, jyoti bani pran,
[01:58.37]Greek bhi jaante the anda ka gyaan।
[02:02.18]Nile ki ret pe ek cosmic egg pada,
[02:05.99]Ra nikla usme se, surya ban khada।
[02:09.79]Lotus se utha prakash ka saar,
[02:13.60]Ande mein chhupa tha poora sansar।
[02:17.40]Par phir aaya ek yug ajeeb sa bhai,
[02:21.21]Humpty Dumpty deewar pe chadh gaya bhai।
[02:25.02]Gir gaya clock ke chakra mein ek din,
[02:28.82]Aur toot gaya anda — kho gaya origin।
[02:32.63]King ke log gin rahe seconds aur saal,
[02:36.43]Par kho gaya cosmic anda ka khayal।
[02:40.24]Hum tukde nahi, hum brahmand hain,
[02:44.05]Purusha ke andar sab praan hain।
[02:47.85]Wǒmen shì yī gè (We are one) — ek hi praan,
[02:51.66]Sabhi sabhyataon ka ek hi gyaan।
[02:55.46]Aika (Time) ke chakra mein mat kho jaana,
[02:59.27]Ande ke andar ka satya pehchana।
[03:03.08]Rigveda bole — anda hi brahmand ka beej,
[03:06.88]China bole — Pangu hai uska seed.
[03:10.69]Finland bole — hans ne diya prakash,
[03:14.49]Egypt bole — anda mein chhupa surya ka vikas।
[03:18.30]Greek bole — Phanes jyoti ka swar,
[03:22.11]Aur Bharat bole — Purusha hi sansar।
[03:25.91]Hemant bole duniya ke beech khada,
[03:29.72]Sabhi sabhyataon ka ek hi anda।
[03:33.52]Break the shell, see the light,
[03:37.33]You are the cosmos in the night.
[03:41.14]Anda nahi kahani hai,
[03:44.94]Ye hi sabse purani hai।
[03:48.75]Jab tak tu khud ko samjhega nahi,
[03:52.55]Tab tak brahmand khुलेगा नहीं।
